// compiler-guide.md "Testing a tree": `tests/test_tree/...` tests each package
// here and below as a root of its own. This one imports `inner`, whose tests
// run once, under its own path, and not in this package's report.
package test_tree;

import "./d_nested/inner";

@(test)
root_passes :: proc() {
	assert(inner.answer() == 42);
}
